{"title":"Community comparison: get ready","markdown":{"headingText":"Community comparison: get ready","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n**Question:** How do community composition and diversity vary between two groups?\n\n**Inputs:** 24 synthetic samples, 12 per group, and 15 fictional features.\n\n**Finish with:** composition, diversity, and count-total figures; checked tables; a short report.\n\nThis is a descriptive teaching example. Visual differences alone do not establish statistical significance or causation. When adapting it, check that the methods suit your study design.\n\nTo explore without installing software, open [See the result](01-see-the-result.qmd). To reproduce the analysis, complete the setup below once.\n\n## Prepare your environment\n\nYou need R, Quarto, and a text editor such as VS Code or RStudio.\n\n### Open the project root\n\nDownload and extract the repository, then open the folder containing `_quarto.yml`, `renv.lock`, `data/`, and `scripts/` in your editor.\n\nOpen a terminal in that folder. Run every command in this example from this project root, including commands shown on pages stored inside `examples/`.\n\n### Restore the R environment\n\nIn the terminal, start R:\n\n```bash\nR\n```\n\nAt the R prompt (`>`), run:\n\n```r\noptions(repos = c(CRAN = \"https://cloud.r-project.org\"))\n\nif (!requireNamespace(\"renv\", quietly = TRUE)) {\n  install.packages(\"renv\")\n}\n\nrenv::restore()\nrenv::status()\n```\n\nIf asked to proceed, enter `Y` and wait for the `>` prompt before entering another command. Restore the supplied lockfile rather than initializing a new environment.\n\nCheck that the analysis packages load, then return to the terminal:\n\n```r\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(vegan)\n\nq(save = \"no\")\n```\n\n::: {.callout-note}\n**If setup fails:** copy the error message. Ask AI to explain it using your R version, operating system, and the command you ran. Check the proposed fix before applying it. Keep the supplied lockfile intact while investigating.\n:::\n\n## Ready to begin?\n\n- Your terminal is open at the project root.\n- `renv::status()` reports no synchronization issues.\n- Both analysis packages load successfully.\n\nContinue to [1. See the result](01-see-the-result.qmd).\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":false,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":false,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"message":false,"working-dir":"../..","engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":true,"code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":true,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","toc":true,"toc-depth":3,"number-sections":false,"css":["../../assets/css/cdi.css"],"output-file":"00-start-here.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"Table of contents","toc-title-website":"On this page","related-formats-title":"Other Formats","related-notebooks-title":"Notebooks","source-notebooks-prefix":"Sour